title: Letter
---
Maia: By Sunday? But that's today. I think mamu must have mailed this earlier. It's possible the post was delayed by the rain.
===

title: Phone
---
<<declare $firstMamuCall = true>>
<<declare $isSmoke = false>>
Mamu: Maia beta, how is the packing coming along?
Maia: Hello mamu. I hope you are well too. I actually haven't started packing yet. Just got your letter.
<<smoke Phone>>
Mamu: What? That can't be right. I mailed it more than a week ago. You must have missed it.
Mamu: That is understandable. However, nothing we can do about it. The movers will be there in the evening. Just clear out the furniture by then so they can take those away.
<<set $isSmoke to true>>
<<audio_sfx AudioManager Smoke Loop>>
Maia: But I -
Mamu: Take care.
<<audio_sfx AudioManager PhoneCut Once>>
Maia: *Sigh*. Where do I even start? Wait, what is that smell?
===

title: NaniRoom
---
Maia: Oh, I don't think I am ready to step into Nani's room just yet.
===
title: Lamp
---
Maia: This lamp is the last present Nani gave me...
Maia: Can't believe it was just last week when I assembled it and placed it here.
Maia: The glasswork is so pretty. Seeing it glint in the sunlight almost gets me teary-eyed.
===

title: MaiaRoom
---
Maia: Oh no. I forgot about the brewing Sundrip fragrance. I need to put this fire out somehow.
===

title: InventoryItem
---
<<declare $itemName = "">>
{$itemName} added to inventory!
<<if $itemName == "Jalpari Scales">>
    Maia: Guess I have no reason to hide these things anymore.
<<endif>>
===

title: Potion
---
Maia: Any later, and mamu wouldn't have had a house to claim.
Maia: It's such a shame though, the Sundrip fragrance was nani's favourite.
Maia: I must make it again to dispel the smell of burnt potion.
Maia: Actually, now that nani...isn't...or I mean she can't...see what I'm doing, I can just brew potions in the kitchen I guess.
Maia: I should gather the ingredients again.
===

title: SecondCall
---
Mamu: Maia, just talked to the movers, they'll be there at 6pm.
Maia: Mamu...I don't think I can do this.
Mamu: Sure, you can. The value of Nani ka Ghar will only depreciate further the longer we wait.
Mamu: You know, I have been insisting on selling this house for a long time. Only your nani wouldn't listen...
Maia: I just...I need more time.
Mamu: We don't have time beta. Pick yourself up, c'mon.
...
===

title: PotionSuccess
---
Maia: This fragrance reminds me of nani. She loves it.
Maia: She would try to guess its notes, nagging me to tell her what was the one she couldn't place.
Maia: She used to say there was something magical about it.
Maia: If only I could tell her...
Maia: Which reminds me, she never told me what the secret ingredient in her Khaplu-famous momos was.
<<audio_sfx AudioManager DoorCreak Once>>
<<wait 2>>
Maia: What was that sound?
===

title: MagicDoorAppear
---
Maia: What?! This- door. How is there a door here?
===

title: MagicDoorFirst
---
<<wait 1>>
Maia: This stained glass panel. It's broken.
Maia: Why does it look so familiar?
===

title: Void
---
<<wait 3>>
<<audio_sfx AudioManager MaiaGasp Once>>
Maia: Noooo!
...
Jump In?
More Coming Soon...
===